    <section id="ganttSheet" class="sheet">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="summary-sheet-toolbar">
          <div>
            <h2>Gantt-chart Schedule</h2>
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: nowrap; gap: 16px; margin: 4px 0 0 0; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase;">
              <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;">
                <span>Current Date:</span>
                <input id="ganttCurrentDateInput" type="date" style="height: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 4px; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 11px;" onchange="updateGanttCurrentDateLine()">
                <button class="btn-secondary" id="updatePercentDayBtn" type="button" style="padding: 4px 10px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; height: 24px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center;" onclick="recalculateProgressPercentDay()">Update Percent (Day)</button>
                <div class="dropdown" style="display: inline-block; position: relative;">
                  <button class="btn-primary" id="ganttUpdateDataBtn" type="button" style="padding: 4px 10px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; height: 24px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px;" onclick="toggleGanttUpdateDataDropdown(event)">
                    Update Data <span style="font-size: 9px; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 1;">▼</span>
                  </button>
                  <div class="dropdown-content" id="ganttUpdateDataDropdown" style="display: none; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 100%; background-color: #fff; min-width: 150px; box-shadow: 0px 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 4px; z-index: 1000; margin-top: 2px;">
                    <a href="#" onclick="showUpdateQtyInst(event)" style="color: var(--text); padding: 8px 12px; text-decoration: none; display: block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;">Update Qty Inst</a>
                    <a href="#" onclick="showBillingRecord(event)" style="color: var(--text); padding: 8px 12px; text-decoration: none; display: block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; border-top: 1px solid var(--line);">Billing Record</a>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <button class="btn-secondary" id="ganttUndoBtn" type="button" style="padding: 4px 10px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; height: 24px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; margin-left: 6px;" onclick="undoGanttAction()" disabled>↩ Undo</button>
                
                <div class="dropdown" style="display: inline-block; position: relative; margin-left: 6px;">
                  <button class="btn-secondary" id="ganttHighlightRowBtn" type="button" style="padding: 4px 10px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; height: 24px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px;" onclick="toggleGanttHighlightDropdown(event)">
                    Row Highlight: Yellow <span style="font-size: 9px; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 1;">▼</span>
                  </button>
                  <div class="dropdown-content" id="ganttHighlightDropdown" style="display: none; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 100%; background-color: #fff; min-width: 160px; box-shadow: 0px 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 4px; z-index: 1000; margin-top: 2px;">
                    <a href="#" onclick="setGanttHighlightMode('none', event)" style="color: var(--text); padding: 8px 12px; text-decoration: none; display: block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;">Disable Highlight</a>
                    <a href="#" onclick="setGanttHighlightMode('yellow', event)" style="color: var(--text); padding: 8px 12px; text-decoration: none; display: block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); background-color: #fef08a;">Highlight Row (Yellow)</a>
                    <a href="#" onclick="setGanttHighlightMode('blue', event)" style="color: var(--text); padding: 8px 12px; text-decoration: none; display: block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); background-color: #bfdbfe;">Highlight Row (Blue)</a>
                    <a href="#" onclick="setGanttHighlightMode('green', event)" style="color: var(--text); padding: 8px 12px; text-decoration: none; display: block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); background-color: #bbf7d0;">Highlight Row (Green)</a>
                    <a href="#" onclick="setGanttHighlightMode('orange', event)" style="color: var(--text); padding: 8px 12px; text-decoration: none; display: block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); background-color: #fed7aa;">Highlight Row (Orange)</a>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="gantt-view-options" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;">
                <span>Scale:</span>
                <button class="btn-secondary activeScale" type="button" onclick="setGanttScale('days')" id="scaleDaysBtn" style="padding: 4px 10px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; height: 24px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center;">Days</button>
                <button class="btn-secondary" type="button" onclick="setGanttScale('weeks')" id="scaleWeeksBtn" style="padding: 4px 10px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; height: 24px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center;">Weeks</button>
                <button class="btn-secondary" type="button" onclick="setGanttScale('months')" id="scaleMonthsBtn" style="padding: 4px 10px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; height: 24px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center;">Months</button>
                <button class="btn-secondary" type="button" onclick="setGanttScale('quarters')" id="scaleQuartersBtn" style="padding: 4px 10px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; height: 24px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center;">Quarters</button>
              </div>

              <div class="gantt-view-options" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;">
                <span>Coordinates:</span>
                <button class="btn-secondary" type="button" onclick="toggleGanttCoordinates()" id="ganttCoordinatesBtn" style="padding: 4px 10px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; height: 24px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center;">Coordinates</button>
              </div>

              <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;">
                <span>Project Start:</span>
                <input id="ganttProjectStartInput" type="date" onchange="updateGanttProjectStart()" style="height: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 4px; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 11px;">
              </div>

              <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;">
                <span>Project Finish:</span>
                <span id="ganttProjectFinishDisplay" style="padding: 4px 8px; background: var(--bg, #f3f4f6); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 4px; font-size: 11px; display: inline-block; min-width: 80px; text-align: center; text-transform: none; font-weight: normal; color: var(--text-color);"> - </span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="gantt-container" style="display: flex; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; background: var(--card); height: calc(100vh - 220px); min-height: 500px;">
          <!-- Left side: Task list table -->
          <div class="gantt-left-panel" style="width: 750px; flex-shrink: 0; overflow-y: auto; overflow-x: auto; background: var(--bg);">
            <table id="ganttTaskTable" style="width: 750px; border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0; table-layout: fixed;">
              <thead>
                <tr style="height: 48px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--accent); position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 10;">
                  <th style="width: 60px; color: white; text-align: center; font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; border-right: 1px solid var(--accent-dark);">Pred.. No.</th>
                  <th style="width: 50px; color: white; text-align: center; font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; border-right: 1px solid var(--accent-dark);">Code</th>
                  <th style="width: 180px; color: white; text-align: left; padding-left: 8px; font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; border-right: 1px solid var(--accent-dark);">Work Description</th>
                  <th style="width: 90px; color: white; text-align: center; font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; border-right: 1px solid var(--accent-dark);">Start Date</th>
                  <th style="width: 90px; color: white; text-align: center; font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; border-right: 1px solid var(--accent-dark);">Finish Date</th>
                  <th style="width: 50px; color: white; text-align: center; font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; border-right: 1px solid var(--accent-dark);">Days</th>
                  <th style="width: 80px; color: white; text-align: center; font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; border-right: 1px solid var(--accent-dark);">Predecessors</th>
                  <th style="width: 100px; color: white; text-align: center; font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; border-right: 1px solid var(--accent-dark);">Cost</th>
                  <th style="width: 50px; color: white; text-align: center; font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase;">Progress %</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody></tbody>
            </table>
          </div>

          <!-- Divider: resizable splitter -->
          <div class="gantt-divider" title="Drag to resize panels"></div>

          <!-- Right side: Gantt chart timeline -->
          <div class="gantt-right-panel" id="ganttRightPanel" style="flex-grow: 1; overflow: auto; position: relative;">
            <div id="ganttTimelineHeader" style="position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 20; background: var(--card); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); height: 48px;"></div>
            <div id="ganttTimelineBody" style="position: relative;"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

            <section id="coverLetterSheet" class="sheet">
      <div class="card cover-workspace-card">
        <!-- Top Workspace Toolbar -->
        <div class="cover-workspace-toolbar">
          <div class="cover-toolbar-left">
            <div class="cover-toolbar-title-group">
              <h2 class="cover-workspace-title">Cost Proposal &amp; Cover Letter</h2>
              <span class="cover-status-badge">Live Preview</span>
              <span id="coverPageFormatBadge" class="cover-page-badge">A4 Portrait</span>
              <span id="coverPageBadge" class="cover-page-badge">1 Page</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="cover-toolbar-right">
            <!-- Zoom Controls -->
            <div class="cover-zoom-controls" title="Preview Zoom">
              <button type="button" class="btn-zoom" onclick="changeCoverZoom(-0.1)" title="Zoom Out" aria-label="Zoom Out">&minus;</button>
              <button type="button" class="btn-zoom-display" id="coverZoomLabel" onclick="setCoverZoom(1)" title="Reset to 100%">100%</button>
              <button type="button" class="btn-zoom" onclick="changeCoverZoom(0.1)" title="Zoom In" aria-label="Zoom In">&plus;</button>
              <button type="button" class="btn-zoom-fit" onclick="fitCoverPreview()" title="Fit to Screen">Fit</button>
            </div>

            <!-- Sidebar Toggle Button -->
            <button type="button" class="btn-secondary btn-toggle-sidebar" id="toggleCoverSidebarBtn" onclick="toggleCoverSidebar()" title="Toggle Configuration Sidebar">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 4px;"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="9" y1="3" x2="9" y2="21"></line></svg>
              <span id="toggleCoverSidebarText">Hide Settings</span>
            </button>

            <!-- Quick Actions -->
            <button class="btn-primary" type="button" id="btnRegenerateCoverTop" onclick="regenerateCoverProposalFromData()" title="Refresh and regenerate proposal content from current BOQ and Schedule data" style="font-weight: 700;">&#128260; Regenerate</button>
            <button class="btn-secondary" type="button" onclick="showBOQSummarySheet()" title="View Summary of BOQ">Summary of BOQ</button>
            <!-- Dedicated PDF Print Actions -->
            <div class="cover-print-actions-group" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px;">
              <button class="btn-secondary" type="button" onclick="printCoverProposalOnlyPdf()" title="Print Cost Proposal / Cover Letter only as PDF (Portrait)" style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 11px; padding: 5px 9px;">&#128438; Print Proposal PDF</button>
              <button class="btn-secondary" type="button" onclick="printCoverAttachmentsOnlyPdf()" title="Print Attachments &amp; Annexes only as PDF (Auto-detects Landscape or Portrait)" style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 11px; padding: 5px 9px;">&#128438; Print Attachments PDF</button>
              <button class="btn-secondary" type="button" onclick="printCoverWholePdf()" title="Print Complete Package (Proposal + Attachments)" style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 11px; padding: 5px 9px;">&#128438; Print Whole</button>
            </div>
            <select id="toolbarCoverPrintScope" onchange="syncCoverPrintScope(this.value)" class="cover-scope-select" title="Select print/export content" style="font-size: 11px; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--card); color: var(--text); height: 28px; cursor: pointer;">
              <option value="all" selected>Scope: Whole Document</option>
              <option value="proposal">Scope: Proposal Only</option>
              <option value="attachments">Scope: Attachments Only</option>
            </select>
            <button class="btn-secondary" type="button" onclick="exportCoverProposalWord()" title="Export Proposal to Word">Convert to Word</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Split Workspace: Sidebar + Preview Canvas -->
        <div class="cover-workspace" id="coverWorkspace">

          <!-- CONFIGURATION SIDEBAR -->
          <aside class="cover-sidebar" id="coverSidebar">
            <div class="cover-sidebar-header">
              <div class="cover-sidebar-title">
                <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 5px;"><path d="M12.22 2h-.44a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v.18a2 2 0 0 1-1 1.73l-.43.25a2 2 0 0 1-2 0l-.15-.08a2 2 0 0 0-2.73.73l-.22.38a2 2 0 0 0 .73 2.73l.15.1a2 2 0 0 1 1 1.72v.51a2 2 0 0 1-1 1.74l-.15.09a2 2 0 0 0-.73 2.73l.22.38a2 2 0 0 0 2.73.73l.15-.08a2 2 0 0 1 2 0l.43.25a2 2 0 0 1 1 1.73V20a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h.44a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-.18a2 2 0 0 1 1-1.73l.43-.25a2 2 0 0 1 2 0l.15.08a2 2 0 0 0 2.73-.73l.22-.39a2 2 0 0 0-.73-2.73l-.15-.08a2 2 0 0 1-1-1.74v-.5a2 2 0 0 1 1-1.74l.15-.09a2 2 0 0 0 .73-2.73l-.22-.38a2 2 0 0 0-2.73-.73l-.15.08a2 2 0 0 1-2 0l-.43-.25a2 2 0 0 1-1-1.73V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg>
                <span>Proposal Settings</span>
              </div>
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary btn-small" id="btnToggleAllSidebarGroups" onclick="toggleAllCoverSidebarGroups()" title="Expand or collapse all sections" style="padding: 2px 8px; font-size: 10.5px; height: 24px; white-space: nowrap !important;">
                  <span id="btnToggleAllSidebarGroupsText">Collapse All</span>
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="cover-sidebar-close" onclick="toggleCoverSidebar()" title="Hide Sidebar">&times;</button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="cover-sidebar-scroll">
              <!-- Quick Action: Regenerate Proposal -->
              <div style="padding: 10px 12px; background: #eff6ff; border: 1px solid #bfdbfe; margin: 0 0 10px 0; border-radius: 6px;">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" onclick="regenerateCoverProposalFromData()" style="width: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 6px; font-weight: 700; padding: 7px 12px; font-size: 11.5px; background: #2563eb; color: #fff; border: none; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer;">
                  <span style="font-size: 14px;">&#128260;</span> Regenerate Proposal from Data
                </button>
                <div style="font-size: 10px; color: #1e40af; margin-top: 4px; line-height: 1.3; text-align: center;">
                  Refreshes cost summary, deliverables, methodologies, exclusions (OSM / By Others / Excluded), and schedule duration from active BOQ.
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Section 1: Page Setup & Layout -->
              <details class="cover-sidebar-group" open>
                <summary class="cover-sidebar-group-title">
                  <span>1. Page Setup &amp; Layout</span>
                  <span class="cover-chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </summary>
                <div class="cover-sidebar-group-content">
                  <div class="cover-field-row">
                    <div class="cover-field">
                      <label for="sbCoverPaperSize">Paper Size</label>
                      <select id="sbCoverPaperSize" onchange="onCoverPageSetupChange()">
                        <option value="A4" selected>A4 (210 &times; 297 mm)</option>
                        <option value="Letter">Letter (8.5 &times; 11 in)</option>
                        <option value="Legal">Legal (8.5 &times; 14 in)</option>
                      </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="cover-field">
                      <label for="sbCoverOrientation">Layout</label>
                      <select id="sbCoverOrientation" onchange="onCoverPageSetupChange()">
                        <option value="portrait" selected>Portrait</option>
                        <option value="landscape">Landscape</option>
                      </select>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="cover-field" style="margin-top: 6px;">
                    <label for="sbCoverPrintScope">Print / PDF Content Scope</label>
                    <select id="sbCoverPrintScope" onchange="syncCoverPrintScope(this.value)">
                      <option value="all" selected>Whole Document (Proposal + Attachments)</option>
                      <option value="proposal">Cost Proposal Only</option>
                      <option value="attachments">Attachments Only</option>
                    </select>
                  </div>
                  <div style="display: flex; gap: 6px; margin-top: 4px;">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="printCoverProposalOnlyPdf()" style="flex: 1; padding: 5px 6px; font-size: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 3px;" title="Print Cost Proposal / Cover Letter only as PDF (Portrait)">
                      <span>&#128438;</span> Print Proposal PDF
                    </button>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="printCoverAttachmentsOnlyPdf()" style="flex: 1; padding: 5px 6px; font-size: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 3px;" title="Print Attachments only as PDF (Matches orientation)">
                      <span>&#128438;</span> Print Attachments PDF
                    </button>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </details>

              <!-- Section 2: Top Header & Document Control -->
              <details class="cover-sidebar-group" open>
                <summary class="cover-sidebar-group-title">
                  <span>2. Header &amp; Doc Control</span>
                  <span class="cover-chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </summary>
                <div class="cover-sidebar-group-content">
                  <div class="cover-field">
                    <label for="sbCoverDocTitle">Header Document Title</label>
                    <input id="sbCoverDocTitle" type="text" value="CONSTRUCTION COST PROPOSAL">
                  </div>
                  <div class="cover-field-row">
                    <div class="cover-field">
                      <label for="sbCoverDocNo">Doc No.</label>
                      <input id="sbCoverDocNo" type="text" value="FM-OPN-01-06">
                    </div>
                    <div class="cover-field">
                      <label for="sbCoverRevNo">Rev. No.</label>
                      <input id="sbCoverRevNo" type="text" value="Rev. No. 0">
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="cover-field">
                    <label for="sbCoverEffectiveDate">Effective Date</label>
                    <input id="sbCoverEffectiveDate" type="text" value="7/2/2026">
                  </div>
                </div>
              </details>

              <!-- Section 3: Project & Client Info -->
              <details class="cover-sidebar-group" open>
                <summary class="cover-sidebar-group-title">
                  <span>3. Project &amp; Client Details</span>
                  <span class="cover-chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </summary>
                <div class="cover-sidebar-group-content">
                  <div class="cover-field">
                    <label for="sbCoverProposalDate">Proposal Date</label>
                    <input id="sbCoverProposalDate" type="date">
                  </div>
                  <div class="cover-field">
                    <label for="sbCoverProjectName">Project Name</label>
                    <input id="sbCoverProjectName" type="text" placeholder="Project Name">
                  </div>
                  <div class="cover-field">
                    <label for="sbCoverClientName">Client / Owner</label>
                    <input id="sbCoverClientName" type="text" placeholder="Client Name">
                  </div>
                  <div class="cover-field">
                    <label for="sbCoverSubject">Proposal Subject</label>
                    <input id="sbCoverSubject" type="text" placeholder="Subject">
                  </div>
                  <button type="button" class="btn-secondary btn-xs" onclick="syncCoverLetterFields()" style="margin-top: 2px;">
                    &#8635; Re-sync from BOQ Data
                  </button>
                </div>
              </details>

              <!-- Section 4: Proposal Intro & Salutation -->
              <details class="cover-sidebar-group">
                <summary class="cover-sidebar-group-title">
                  <span>4. Salutation &amp; Intro Text</span>
                  <span class="cover-chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </summary>
                <div class="cover-sidebar-group-content">
                  <div class="cover-field">
                    <label for="sbCoverSalutation">Salutation</label>
                    <input id="sbCoverSalutation" type="text" value="Dear Sir/Madam,">
                  </div>
                  <div class="cover-field">
                    <label for="sbCoverOpeningText">Opening Statement</label>
                    <textarea id="sbCoverOpeningText" rows="2">We are pleased to submit our cost proposal for the above-mentioned project for your review and consideration.</textarea>
                  </div>
                  <div class="cover-field">
                    <label for="sbCoverScopeIntro">Scope &amp; BOQ Statement</label>
                    <textarea id="sbCoverScopeIntro" rows="3">This proposal has been prepared based on the project requirements, applicable scope of works, and the Summary of Bill of Quantities. The submitted amount reflects the estimated construction cost, including the required materials, labor, equipment, applicable multiplier factors for overhead cost and profit, and VAT or Non-VAT treatment as determined by the BOQ Summary.</textarea>
                  </div>
                  <div class="cover-field">
                    <label for="sbCoverBreakdownIntro">Breakdown Intro Statement</label>
                    <textarea id="sbCoverBreakdownIntro" rows="3">The cost breakdown by main category is presented below. The amounts shown represent the total cost per category, including all applicable adjustments for overhead, profit, and VAT as derived from the BOQ cost factors. Any revision in scope, specifications, quantity, site condition, or client instruction may require corresponding adjustment to the proposal amount.</textarea>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </details>

              <!-- Section 5: Key Deliverables & Methodologies -->
              <details class="cover-sidebar-group" open>
                <summary class="cover-sidebar-group-title">
                  <span>5. Key Deliverables &amp; Methodologies</span>
                  <span class="cover-chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </summary>
                <div class="cover-sidebar-group-content">
                  <div style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" id="btnSyncCoverDeliverablesBOQ" title="Generate deliverables and methodologies based on BOQ categories" style="width: 100%; padding: 6px 10px; font-size: 11px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 6px;">
                      <span style="font-size: 13px;">&#128260;</span> Sync Deliverables &amp; Methods from BOQ
                    </button>
                  </div>
                  <div class="cover-field">
                    <label for="sbCoverKeyDeliverables">Key Project Deliverables (from BOQ)</label>
                    <textarea id="sbCoverKeyDeliverables" rows="6">1. General Requirements &amp; Mobilization: Complete site establishment, temporary facilities, construction health &amp; safety programs (DOLE-OSHC compliant), engineering supervision, project signboards, and final site demobilization.

2. Earthworks &amp; Substructure: Site clearing, precision excavation for column footings and tie beams, soil poisoning/anti-termite treatment, backfilling, and mechanized layer-by-layer compaction.

3. Reinforced Concrete &amp; Structural Works: Fabrication and installation of standard deformed reinforcing steel bars (Grade 40/60), formworks and falsework scaffolding, and ready-mix structural concrete pouring for footings, columns, beams, and suspended slabs.

4. Masonry &amp; Plastering Works: Laying of load-bearing/non-load-bearing Concrete Hollow Blocks (CHB) with required dowel rebar reinforcement, and cement plaster finishing on all exposed concrete/masonry surfaces.

5. Architectural Finishes &amp; Specialties: Ceramic and porcelain floor/wall tiling, thermal/moisture ceiling systems, doors, windows, and premium multi-coat interior/exterior painting systems.

6. MEPF Services Infrastructure: Complete roughing-ins and fixture terminations for sanitary drainage, potable water distribution, electrical power/lighting distribution boards, and fire protection provisions in strict compliance with the National Building Code.</textarea>
                  </div>
                  <div class="cover-field">
                    <label for="sbCoverMethodologies">Construction Methodology &amp; QA/QC Standards</label>
                    <textarea id="sbCoverMethodologies" rows="6">1. Mobilization &amp; Health/Safety Protocols: Rapid deployment of equipment, construction safety barriers, PPE enforcement, and securing required building clearances prior to breaking ground in full compliance with DOLE DO-13 standards.

2. Substructure &amp; Civil Execution: Systematic excavation guided by optical laser benchmarks, rigorous soil sub-grade verification, and controlled backfill compaction with field density testing (FDT) prior to concrete footing placement.

3. Structural Quality Assurance: Pre-pour joint inspections checking rebar lap splices, spacing, and concrete cover chairs; continuous slump testing on site; and mandatory 7-day, 14-day, and 28-day laboratory concrete cylinder compressive strength tests.

4. Surface Preparation &amp; Finishing Standards: Mechanical keying and slurry bonding application prior to wall plastering; rigorous leveling using optical lasers for screeds, tiles, and ceiling grids; and moisture testing before primer and topcoat paint applications.

5. MEPF Testing &amp; Commissioning: 24-hour hydrostatic pressure testing (minimum 100 psi) on all water piping; flood/smoke testing on drainage and vent piping; continuity and megger insulation testing on electrical wiring prior to final circuit energization.

6. Final Punchlisting &amp; Turnover: Multi-tier quality audits with the Project Manager, systematic rectification of snag lists, handover of complete As-Built drawings, and turnover of manufacturer warranty certificates.</textarea>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </details>

              <!-- Section 6: Commercial Terms & Conditions -->
              <details class="cover-sidebar-group">
                <summary class="cover-sidebar-group-title">
                  <span>6. Commercial Terms &amp; Conditions</span>
                  <span class="cover-chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </summary>
                <div class="cover-sidebar-group-content">
                  <!-- Duration Settings Grid -->
                  <div style="background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                    <div style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 6px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;">
                      <span>Project Duration Settings</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="cover-field-row" style="margin-bottom: 6px;">
                      <div class="cover-field">
                        <label for="sbCoverDurationDays">Calendar Days</label>
                        <input id="sbCoverDurationDays" type="number" min="1" value="120" placeholder="120" style="font-weight: 700;">
                      </div>
                      <div class="cover-field">
                        <label for="sbCoverWorkingDays">Working Days</label>
                        <input id="sbCoverWorkingDays" type="number" min="1" value="102" placeholder="102" style="font-weight: 700;">
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="cover-field" style="margin-bottom: 6px;">
                      <label for="sbCoverDurationBasis">Work Week Basis</label>
                      <select id="sbCoverDurationBasis" style="font-size: 11px; padding: 5px 6px;">
                        <option value="6-day" selected>6-Day Work Week (Mon - Sat)</option>
                        <option value="5-day">5-Day Work Week (Mon - Fri)</option>
                        <option value="consecutive">Consecutive Days (7-Day)</option>
                      </select>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                      <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" id="btnSyncCoverDurationGantt" title="Calculate total project duration from BOQ Schedule / Gantt tasks" style="width: 100%; padding: 5px 8px; font-size: 10.5px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 5px;">
                        <span>&#128197;</span> Sync Duration from Schedule (Gantt)
                      </button>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div class="cover-field">
                    <label for="sbCoverPaymentTerms">Terms of Payment</label>
                    <textarea id="sbCoverPaymentTerms" rows="5">1. Mobilization Downpayment: A fifteen percent (15%) advance payment upon contract signing and receipt of Notice to Proceed (NTP), deductible pro-rata from each progress billing.

2. Monthly Progress Billings: Progress billings shall be submitted on a monthly cut-off cycle reflecting actual physical accomplishment validated through joint site quantity measurements.

3. Applicable Rates &amp; Inclusions: Billing valuation shall apply the approved Bill of Quantities (BOQ) unit rates, inclusive of direct costs, equipment overhead, contractor profit, and applicable tax/VAT treatments.

4. Retention Guarantee: A ten percent (10%) retention fee shall be deducted from each progress payment, to be released upon final turnover, completion of punchlist items, and issuance of Certificate of Final Acceptance.

5. Invoicing &amp; Settlement: All validated billing invoices shall be processed and settled within fifteen (15) calendar days from receipt of billing statement.</textarea>
                  </div>
                  <div class="cover-field">
                    <label for="sbCoverQuotationDuration">Duration of Quotation</label>
                    <textarea id="sbCoverQuotationDuration" rows="4">1. Validity Period: This commercial proposal and its corresponding unit rates remain firm and valid for thirty (30) calendar days from the date of submission.

2. Cost Basis: Rates are strictly calculated based on Direct Unit Price Analysis (DUPA), prevailing material supplier rates, and current statutory labor wage orders.

3. Adjustment Upon Expiry: Acceptance after the 30-day validity window shall be subject to mutual re-evaluation and adjustment based on published material price indexes and prevailing market conditions.</textarea>
                  </div>
                  <div class="cover-field">
                    <label for="sbCoverProjectDuration">Duration of Project</label>
                    <textarea id="sbCoverProjectDuration" rows="5">1. Contract Duration: The total project completion period is estimated at 120 Calendar Days (approx. 102 Working Days, based on a 6-day work week), commencing within seven (7) calendar days from receipt of Notice to Proceed (NTP) and site possession.

2. Milestone Schedule Baseline: A detailed CPM Gantt Chart and S-Curve progress baseline shall be submitted prior to mobilization and shall govern critical milestone tracking.

3. Extension of Time (EOT): Excusable delays—including force majeure, unworkable weather beyond statistical averages, client-directed scope revisions, or delayed owner approvals—shall entitle the Contractor to an equitable extension of time without penalty.

4. Substantial Completion &amp; Handover: Substantial completion shall be declared when works are at least 95% complete and safely serviceable for their intended purpose, subject only to punchlist item rectifications.</textarea>
                  </div>
                  <div class="cover-field">
                    <label for="sbCoverSpecialConditions">Special Conditions</label>
                    <textarea id="sbCoverSpecialConditions" rows="5">1. Site &amp; Plan Verification: This proposal is subject to final joint site verification of benchmarks, elevations, boundary monuments, and actual field conditions.

2. Change Orders &amp; Scope Variations: Any additions, deductions, or scope deviations from the approved BOQ shall be priced using the established DUPA cost factors and approved in writing prior to execution.

3. Quantity Variance Threshold: Should actual site quantities deviate by more than fifteen percent (15%) from the estimated BOQ quantities through no fault of the Contractor, unit rates for the affected variance may be equitably renegotiated.

4. Work Hours &amp; Accelerated Work: Work shall proceed during standard permitted construction hours (Mon–Sat, 8:00 AM – 5:00 PM). Overtime or night shift operations requested by the Client for schedule acceleration shall be subject to mutual agreement and night differential reimbursement.</textarea>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </details>

              <!-- Section 7: Scope Clarifications & Exclusions -->
              <details class="cover-sidebar-group">
                <summary class="cover-sidebar-group-title">
                  <span>7. Scope Clarifications &amp; Exclusions</span>
                  <span class="cover-chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </summary>
                <div class="cover-sidebar-group-content">
                  <div class="cover-field">
                    <label for="sbCoverExcludedItems">Not Included in Work / Exclusions</label>
                    <textarea id="sbCoverExcludedItems" rows="5">1. Government Permits &amp; Fees: Building permits, occupancy clearances, fire safety inspection certificates, zoning clearances, and local government assessment fees (unless explicitly itemized in the BOQ).

2. Utility Infrastructure Charges: Permanent electric transformer installations/tapping fees, permanent water meter connection fees, and sewerage tapping charges assessed by utility concessionaires.

3. Engineering &amp; Specialist Testing: Geotechnical soil boring investigations, seismic audits, environmental impact assessments, and structural retrofitting of existing adjacent structures.

4. Pre-existing Structural Rectification: Repair or rectification of structural deficiencies, misaligned substructures, or substandard concrete poured by prior contractors.

5. External &amp; Off-Site Development: Off-site drainage works, utility extensions beyond property boundaries, and third-party security bonds beyond contract retention stipulations.</textarea>
                  </div>
                  <div class="cover-field">
                    <label for="sbCoverClientMaterials">Owner-Supplied Materials (OSM)</label>
                    <textarea id="sbCoverClientMaterials" rows="5">1. Supply &amp; Delivery: All Owner-Supplied Materials (OSM) and client-furnished equipment shall be delivered to the jobsite freight-prepaid, properly crated, and aligned with the agreed project procurement timeline.

2. Quality &amp; Specifications: The Client warrants that all OSM comply with project engineering specifications, building codes, and manufacturer quality standards.

3. Site Handling &amp; Storage: The Contractor shall provide reasonable protection and secure storage for OSM upon turnover, exercising standard care against loss or weather damage.

4. Delivery Delays &amp; Compensation: Any delay in OSM turnover, defective materials requiring replacement, or manufacturer shortages impacting the critical path shall entitle the Contractor to a day-for-day time extension and reimbursement of verified standby labor/equipment costs.</textarea>
                  </div>
                  <div class="cover-field">
                    <label for="sbCoverOtherContractors">Works by Other Contractors / Coordination</label>
                    <textarea id="sbCoverOtherContractors" rows="5">1. Interface Coordination: Works executed by the Client's independent trade contractors (e.g. structured cabling, specialty HVAC, elevator equipment, interior fitters) must be pre-coordinated with the Contractor's site management.

2. Protection of Installed Works: Independent trade contractors must respect completed works. Any damage inflicted onto finished finishes, MEPF lines, or waterproofing shall be rectified at the Client's expense.

3. Shared Hoisting &amp; Temporary Power: Access to vertical hoisting equipment, craneage, temporary power, and staging yards must be scheduled in advance with the Contractor's project superintendent.

4. Performance &amp; Liability Disclaimer: The Contractor assumes no liability for operational failures, schedule delays, or warranty liabilities originating from works performed by the Client's independent trade contractors.</textarea>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </details>

