2. Cost Basis: Rates are strictly calculated based on Direct Unit Price Analysis (DUPA), prevailing material supplier rates, and current statutory labor wage orders.

3. Adjustment Upon Expiry: Acceptance after the 30-day validity window shall be subject to mutual re-evaluation and adjustment based on published material price indexes and prevailing market conditions.</textarea>
